  "body": "Title and CCC issued, ready to move in today!\r\n\r\nEmbrace a permanent holiday lifestyle just steps from the serene shores of Waiake Beach. \r\nThis exclusive collection of six brand-new, STANDALONE FREEHOLD residences blends high-end architectural design with effortless coastal living. Minutes from Browns Bay and Torbay, these homes offer the ultimate beachside retreat for families, upsizers, and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe Luxury of Premium Craftsmanship\r\nEvery detail in these residences has been meticulously upgraded to deliver modern comfort, superior durability, and timeless elegance:\r\n\r\n•\tPremium Cladding: Architectural Abodo feature cladding paired with trusted vertical shiplap weatherboards.\r\n•\tElite Insulation: Full double glazing utilizing New Zealand’s leading Omega window systems.\r\n•\tBespoke Interiors: Custom NZ-made kitchens, premium cabinetry, and luxury engineered timber flooring with integrated underfloor waterproofing.\r\n•\tClimate Control: Fully centralized Samsung air conditioning for year-round comfort.\r\n•\tUpgraded Finishes: 13mm enhanced living area ceiling boards, premium hardwood decking, pure wool carpets, and stylish Hager switches.\r\n•\tGourmet Kitchens: High-end Fisher & Paykel appliances, elegant, tiled splashbacks, and a built-in water purification system.\r\n•\tDesigner Bathrooms: Fully tiled luxury bathrooms equipped with premium fixtures and a high capacity 180L hot water cylinder.\r\n•\tAdvanced Security: Upgraded touchscreen alarm systems for ultimate peace of mind with fully fenced homes.\r\n\r\nAn Enviable Location\r\nSituated in a tightly held, safe, and prestigious neighbourhood, 889 Beach Road offers an unparalleled lifestyle. Enjoy morning swims, paddleboarding, and scenic coastal walks right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also secure top-tier education, with elite school zoning for:\r\n•\tTorbay Primary\r\n•\tNorthcross Intermediate\r\n•\tLong Bay College\r\n\r\nExclusive Site Plan & Configurations\r\nChoose the layout that perfectly fits your lifestyle. All options include a Single Garage:\r\n\r\nResidence \tFA\t        \tLA \t\t        Configuration\r\nLot 1\t \t157.1m²\t        258m²\t\t4 Bedrooms + 2.5 Bathrooms\r\nLot 2\t \t161.6m²\t        232m²\t\t4 Bedrooms + 2.5 Bathrooms\r\nLot 3\t\t166.7m²\t        211m²\t\t4 Bedrooms + 2 Bathrooms + 2 Toilets\r\nLot 4\t \t152.0m²\t        232m²\t\t4 Bedrooms + 2.5 Bathrooms\r\nLot 5\t \t159.6m²\t        177m²\t\t4 Bedrooms + 2.5 Bathrooms\r\nLot 6\t \t158.7m²\t        187m²\t\t4 Bedrooms + 2.5 Bathrooms \r\n\r\nContact us today on 022 364 5005 to arrange a private viewing or to request a comprehensive property information pack!",
